    <string name="sing_intro">Listen to the chord and Do to establish the key, then sing the requested solfege note. Wait for playback to finish.</string>
    <string name="ear_intro">Remember Do, then identify the last note as Do, Re, or Mi. Start with three notes and work up to all seven.</string>
    <string name="movable_do_hint">Movable Do follows the key, not a fixed C. Do stays the same within a round; a new round selects a new key.</string>
